name: Explicit chunk reuse and retry planning preserve scope and zero-call work
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/chunked_planning.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: options full-mode:hunt
require-live-snap: 25 Compatibility | legacy-support
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 Reuse cached chunks | cache-setting
keys: Enter C-u
require-live-snap: 25 EDIT Reuse cached chunks | cache-editor
type: no
keys: C-g
require-live-snap: 25 Saved globally. | explicit-fresh-setting
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/chunked_planning.py @TMP_TARGET @ART options
submit: logs
submit: run full-mode:hunt {"dryRun":true,"maxTokensPerChunk":1000,"failedChunkIds":[1]}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/chunked_planning.py @TMP_TARGET @ART planned
paste-file: @ART/plan-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · completed | opened-plan-replay
require-live-snap: 25 Planning only | selected-plan
expect: Dollar estimate: uncertain
expect: Cache reuse: disabled
resize: 160x48
live-snap: planning-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: planning-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: planning-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: planning-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: planning-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: planning-reading-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: planning-reading-40x12-2
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: planning-reading-40x12-3
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: planning-reading-40x12-4
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: planning-reading-40x12-5
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: planning-reading-40x12-6
ask: Across six sizes, can the operator distinguish one selected planning chunk from executed discovery and read the cache and uncertain-cost implications before approving work?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: logs
submit: run full-mode:hunt {"dryRun":true,"failedChunkIds":[]}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/chunked_planning.py @TMP_TARGET @ART empty
require-live-snap: 25 failedChunkIds is empty | empty-refusal
submit: run full-mode:hunt {"dryRun":true,"failedChunkIds":[999]}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/chunked_planning.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unknown
require-live-snap: 25 absent from this plan | unknown-refusal
submit: run full-mode:hunt {"dryRun":true,"scopeFile":"empty-scope.txt"}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/chunked_planning.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scope-empty
require-live-snap: 25 scopeFile is empty | empty-scope-refusal
submit: run full-mode:hunt {"dryRun":true,"scopeFile":"outside-scope.txt"}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/chunked_planning.py @TMP_TARGET @ART outside
require-live-snap: 25 invalid scoped source path | outside-scope-refusal
submit: run agentic-sast:scan {"strategy":"chunked","scanScopeRef":{}}
require-live-snap: 25 cannot honor scanScopeRef | scope-refusal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/chunked_planning.py @TMP_TARGET @ART blocked
paste-file: @ART/blocked-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · blocked | blocked-replay
resize: 160x48
live-snap: refusal-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: refusal-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: refusal-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: refusal-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: refusal-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: refusal-reading-40x12
ask: Across six sizes, are unsupported chunked scope and retry refusals actionable without implying a model or full-repository scan ran?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Finding review completeness does not describe repository coverage. | planning-report
expect: 0 findings
expect: Displayed Scan: blocked
expect: No model request started.
expect-not: Displayed Scan: completed
keys: Home
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/chunked_planning.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does Report avoid treating completed planning and refused retries as primary Scan evidence or clean repository coverage?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: show advanced full-mode:hunt
require-live-snap: 25 Value: no | recovered-setting
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/plan-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · completed | recovered-plan-replay
require-live-snap: 25 Planning only | recovered-plan
expect: Cache reuse: disabled
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/chunked_planning.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the explicit cache setting, selected plan and refusals with zero scan jobs, model calls or source execution?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
